  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 05 01 01 01 05 01 E2 01}直斗有点怪啊。\n到处指来指去的……\n{F2 26 00 00}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_dlc/0008/battle/support/bsv124.bvp_(061).BMD.json:8:0",
  "message_id": "BTL_MES_H124_062_009",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 05 01 01 01 05 01 E1 01}小熊……怎么了？\n好像……在跳舞？\n{F2 26 00 00}{00}"
 },
 {
